<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cause Panic</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Necromancer
Guild Level: 42
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cause panic &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>This spell slowly fills the target with fear. For a while after it takes hold, 
the target has to fight the fear again and again: each time their mind fails 
them, they flee in panic. The stronger the spell, the longer it lasts, until 
the target feels calm again. A strong mind resists it better.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack, and starts a fight.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
